# Local assistant + scaffolding files. Deliberately out of the published
# repo — they are working notes, not part of the product.
#
# NOTE: `.env.example` is ignored here at the owner's request. The variable
# list it used to carry now lives in docs/DEPLOYMENT.md, which is the file to
# read when setting the project up somewhere new. Keep that in step, or the
# next person has no way to discover what the app needs to boot.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Every .env.example in the tree, at any depth. Not just tidiness: the one in
# backend/ was committed and pushed with a live service_role key pasted into
# it. A template file that people fill in locally has no business being
# tracked at all.
.env.example
**/.env.example

# Lichess puzzle dataset — ~300 MB compressed. It is operational *input*, not
# source: re-downloadable any time from https://database.lichess.org/#puzzles,
# and what actually matters (the filtered subset) lives in Postgres after the
# import.
#
# GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100 MB, so committing this would
# break `git push` — and once it is in history, removing it needs a rewrite.
lichess_db_puzzle.csv
lichess_db_puzzle.csv.zst
*.csv.zst
